  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[Song Title: Spectral Groove Compiler]\r\n[Style: modern electro, breakbeat, rubbery synth bass, funky rhythm guitar chops, chopped drum breaks, FM synth leads, percussive claps, modular synth bleeps, clean studio recording, expressive male lead]\r\n[Caption: Turning prompts into motion, one groove at a time.]\r\n[Image: A dancing waveform grid where code fragments pulse like neon circuitry.]\r\n[Refresh Title: Random 7]\r\n[Theme: Random]\r\n[Gradients: 7]\r\n[Rank: 3]\r\n[Title Rarity: 0.45]\r\n[Tempo Lock BPM: 122]\r\n[Created: March 5, 2026 at 6:22 PM]\r\n[Seeds: 903, A:10, B:34, C:44, D:52]\r\n[Perspective: we_community]\r\n[Concept: Humans collaborate with Codex to turn ideas into living visuals—code, rhythm, and iteration fused together.]\r\n[Topic: Human–Machine Duet → creative_iteration]\r\n[Genre Bias: modern electro (→ breakbeat)]\r\n[Style Change: Bridge]\r\n[Modulation: lift up a whole step into Final Chorus]\r\n[Hook Prominence: high]\r\n[Deviation: instrumental_break]\r\n[Visual Mood: uplifting]\r\n[Visual Motion: high]\r\n[Visual Density: dense]\r\n[Visual Lyric Presence: auto]\r\n[Visual Color Bias: cool]\r\n[Composer Version: v2.8]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[angular synth motif repeating in short bursts across stereo field]\r\n[breakbeat fragments gradually assemble into steady groove]\r\n[rhythmic guitar scratches accent offbeats]\r\n[sub bass pulses on dotted rhythm]\r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Visual: scene=hold; motion=medium; density=normal; focus=rhythm]\r\n[melody hops across syncopated intervals]\r\nWe start with a spark of a thought  \r\nDescribe the motion we sought  \r\nVectors dancing on command  \r\nShapes emerge at our demand  \r\n\r\n[Pre-Chorus]\r\n[rising scalar melody that tightens rhythmically]\r\nEvery frame begins to breathe  \r\nLines of code beneath the beat  \r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[Visual: scene=lift; motion=high; density=dense; focus=vocal]\r\n[wide hook melody with rhythmic delay echoes]\r\nCompile the color, spin the light  \r\nGroove the graph across the night  \r\nPrompt and pulse begin to blend  \r\nWatch the waveform twist and bend  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[melody drops lower with syncopated bass response]\r\nCodex hums behind the screen  \r\nParsing what the prompt might mean  \r\nParticles begin to climb  \r\nOrbiting the bassline time  \r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[Visual: scene=contrast; motion=medium; density=sparse; focus=texture]\r\n[Style Change: pads widen while drums fragment]\r\n[smooth melodic arc spanning longer notes]\r\nEvery rule a rhythm thread  \r\nEvery loop a path we tread  \r\nRandom seeds but steady aim  \r\nFunk and code ignite the frame  \r\n\r\n[Instrumental Break]\r\n[FM synth lead improvises over chopped drum fills]\r\n[guitar tapping harmonics answer the synth phrases]\r\n[bass slides through chromatic walk-up]\r\n[drums glitch momentarily before groove re-enters]\r\n\r\n[Final Chorus]\r\n[Key Change: lift up a whole step into Final Chorus]\r\n[anthemic hook doubled with synth harmony]\r\nCompile the color, spin the light  \r\nGroove the graph across the night  \r\nHuman spark and code combine  \r\nPainting rhythm out of time  \r\n\r\n[Ending]\r\n[refrain_tag]\r\nSpin the light, spin the light",
